{
  "id": "list-supplier-price-lists",
  "action_name": "listSupplierPriceLists",
  "name": "Supplier price lists",
  "title": "Supplier price lists",
  "icon": "emoji:🏷️",
  "help_text": "Every purchase price list in Zoho, mirrored nightly by Sync supplier price lists. Read-only here: change a price in Zoho, then sync. A product's page shows its price on every list, and purchase planning prices from them. See docs/supplier-price-lists.md.",
